1
00:00:00,767 --> 00:00:03,200
Then give this to me.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,800
It's not worth much anyway. Take it.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,333
- Really?
- Yeah.

4
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:09,733
- Thanks.
- How could you just give it away?!

5
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:15,600
I thought you understood how I felt.

6
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:17,333
I'm sorry.

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,733
I'm heading back.

8
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:20,833
Hey!

9
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:22,900
You're being completely unreasonable!

10
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,133
So he just left?

11
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:30,800
Well, he said he was leaving.

12
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,167
That's lame.

13
00:00:33,733 --> 00:00:38,700
Maybe I have been looking
out for Omaeda a bit more...

14
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:42,900
but that doesn't mean I'm open to anyone!

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,133
I was so looking forward
to finally seeing him.

16
00:00:47,233 --> 00:00:48,333
And for what?

17
00:00:48,433 --> 00:00:50,467
After the way he talked to me,

18
00:00:50,567 --> 00:00:53,600
of course I'd feel like
he doesn't trust me at all.

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,933
Still, it was our rare
chance to be together,

20
00:00:57,033 --> 00:00:58,113
and I brought Omaeda along.

21
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,300
I do feel bad about that part.

22
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,000
Then tell him that.

23
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,133
I did, but...

24
00:01:04,233 --> 00:01:06,700
at least I thought I made it clear.

25
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,933
Assuming isn't going to cut it.

26
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,567
You guys will be fine, though.

27
00:01:14,667 --> 00:01:15,867
Huh?

28
00:01:16,567 --> 00:01:21,033
A relationship only grows stronger
after being put to the test.

29
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:24,267
That's what Hasegawa-san says.

30
00:01:35,167 --> 00:01:36,733
Hello? Misuzu Mama?

31
00:01:36,833 --> 00:01:39,600
Takoi, get over here right now!

32
00:02:07,033 --> 00:02:10,400
"Duty First, Kiss Later"

33
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,267
(Final Episode)

34
00:02:13,367 --> 00:02:15,300
I knew it was going to
be something like this.

35
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,000
Sorry about this.

36
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,100
I threw out my back.

37
00:02:19,467 --> 00:02:20,467
It hurts so much.

38
00:02:20,867 --> 00:02:22,100
Are you all right?

39
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,333
My back gave out.

40
00:02:24,667 --> 00:02:28,767
Why did I choose today
to ask for doorstep delivery?

41
00:02:28,867 --> 00:02:30,167
What was I thinking?

42
00:02:31,533 --> 00:02:33,167
That's the last of them.

43
00:02:33,267 --> 00:02:34,567
Oh, thanks.

44
00:02:34,667 --> 00:02:36,167
Huh? I haven't seen this one before.

45
00:02:36,267 --> 00:02:37,733
Ah, this is Omaeda.

46
00:02:37,833 --> 00:02:39,400
He joined after Shiono transferred.

47
00:02:39,833 --> 00:02:42,067
Nice to meet you. I'm Omaeda.

48
00:02:43,333 --> 00:02:44,500
Is that so?

49
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:48,067
Well, it's always good to
have fresh faces around.

50
00:02:48,767 --> 00:02:50,900
I'll carry these inside for you.

51
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,433
Thanks, I appreciate it.

52
00:02:55,433 --> 00:02:57,633
By the way, how is Shiono doing?

53
00:03:00,133 --> 00:03:01,833
You two are still in touch, right?

54
00:03:02,267 --> 00:03:03,267
Yeah.

55
00:03:04,133 --> 00:03:05,600
He's doing well.

56
00:03:06,967 --> 00:03:07,967
Really?

57
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:10,367
Good to hear.

58
00:03:14,967 --> 00:03:16,700
We're basically running errands.

59
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
I'm used to her bossing me around.

60
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:20,967
Telling me to drop
everything and rush over...

61
00:03:21,067 --> 00:03:22,567
I thought it was an emergency.

62
00:03:23,433 --> 00:03:23,933
True.

63
00:03:24,033 --> 00:03:27,167
Misuzu Mama has a good heart, though.

64
00:03:30,233 --> 00:03:31,533
Takoi-san.

65
00:03:33,733 --> 00:03:36,067
Are you dating Shiono-san?

66
00:03:36,667 --> 00:03:37,900
What?

67
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:42,267
When HQ came for that inspection,

68
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,967
the two of you were acting weird.

69
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,467
And you went to the hot
springs together, didn't you?

70
00:03:48,133 --> 00:03:50,067
So yesterday...

71
00:03:50,167 --> 00:03:54,733
did he tell you to stop being nice
to a junior who likes you,

72
00:03:54,833 --> 00:03:56,233
and get mad over it?

73
00:03:58,367 --> 00:04:00,100
You have quite an imagination.

74
00:04:01,967 --> 00:04:02,967
Yeah.

75
00:04:03,967 --> 00:04:07,700
Shiono was just jumping to conclusions.

76
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,300
Sorry you got dragged into it.

77
00:04:15,333 --> 00:04:16,467
Huh?

78
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:22,400
I like you.

79
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,967
What?

80
00:04:26,233 --> 00:04:29,000
Back when HQ was here,

81
00:04:29,100 --> 00:04:30,267
I messed up,

82
00:04:30,367 --> 00:04:32,467
and Shiono-san ripped into me.

83
00:04:32,567 --> 00:04:34,700
You were the one who showed
me kindness, remember?

84
00:04:35,467 --> 00:04:37,067
Ever since then,

85
00:04:38,167 --> 00:04:40,067
I've had feelings for you.

86
00:04:43,067 --> 00:04:44,333
Uh, well...

87
00:04:44,667 --> 00:04:46,667
I'm not asking you to break up with him.

88
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:51,533
But when you fight
and you're feeling lonely,

89
00:04:52,267 --> 00:04:54,600
can't you come have some fun with me?

90
00:04:54,767 --> 00:04:55,667
What?

91
00:04:55,767 --> 00:04:57,633
I promise we won't get caught.

92
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:03,033
So just give me a shot too.

93
00:05:07,033 --> 00:05:10,200
Sorry, I don't feel
that way about you.

94
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:14,133
I'm flattered, but...

95
00:05:14,233 --> 00:05:16,033
Shiono-san has it so easy.

96
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,500
Climbing the ladder at work,

97
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,733
and having you love him like that.

98
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,767
When he looks down on everyone around him.

99
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,900
Omaeda...

100
00:05:32,433 --> 00:05:34,233
Sorry, I crossed the line.

101
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:36,467
It's fine. I'll get over it.

102
00:05:38,867 --> 00:05:40,233
Just give me some time.

103
00:05:57,567 --> 00:05:59,600
It's been four days now.

104
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:02,300
Omaeda went AWOL without notice.

105
00:06:02,467 --> 00:06:04,133
Nobody can reach him, right?

106
00:06:04,233 --> 00:06:05,333
Looks that way.

107
00:06:05,433 --> 00:06:07,376
They even checked his
place, but he wasn't there.

108
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:11,267
You don't think he got
mixed up in some trouble?

109
00:06:11,367 --> 00:06:12,800
What...?

110
00:06:16,033 --> 00:06:17,200
What's the matter?

111
00:06:17,300 --> 00:06:18,300
Hmm?

112
00:06:18,333 --> 00:06:19,800
You look pale.

113
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:21,233
Do I?

114
00:06:21,333 --> 00:06:23,467
I was wondering if something happened.

115
00:06:24,067 --> 00:06:26,667
You could say that.

116
00:06:27,967 --> 00:06:28,800
I just heard...

117
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:29,467
Yeah?

118
00:06:29,567 --> 00:06:32,767
Someone who looks like Omaeda was
seen wandering the entertainment district.

119
00:06:32,867 --> 00:06:33,867
What?

120
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:45,900
This is the place, but now what?

121
00:06:50,633 --> 00:06:51,867
Excuse me.

122
00:06:52,267 --> 00:06:54,500
Do you have a minute?

123
00:06:55,767 --> 00:06:56,933
Right now?

124
00:07:10,633 --> 00:07:12,933
The line you dialed is currently busy.

125
00:07:13,567 --> 00:07:15,000
Shu, did you get through to him?

126
00:07:16,567 --> 00:07:18,000
Not yet.

127
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:19,400
I see.

128
00:07:24,567 --> 00:07:26,867
Yama-no-michi, Detective Division.

129
00:07:27,267 --> 00:07:28,567
Is Takoi-san there?

130
00:07:29,233 --> 00:07:30,867
Wait, Shiono?

131
00:07:30,967 --> 00:07:33,300
It's been forever since you called!

132
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:35,300
Is Takoi-san there?

133
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,933
He already left for the day.

134
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,633
He left?

135
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:42,200
He said he had somewhere to go.

136
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:44,700
What's going on?

137
00:07:45,667 --> 00:07:48,233
If Takoi-san contacts you, let me know.

138
00:07:48,333 --> 00:07:50,467
Why don't you just call him yourself...?

139
00:07:51,300 --> 00:07:52,400
Huh?

140
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:53,767
What was that?

141
00:07:54,667 --> 00:07:56,100
What happened?

142
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,100
It was Shiono.

143
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,720
He was asking if Takoi-san was around.

144
00:07:59,100 --> 00:08:00,300
He called all the way here?

145
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,533
Yeah.

146
00:08:02,767 --> 00:08:05,200
I wonder if something's wrong.

147
00:08:16,833 --> 00:08:18,367
Back again today?

148
00:08:18,467 --> 00:08:20,600
You've been here every day lately.

149
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,000
Isn't that risky?

150
00:08:22,267 --> 00:08:24,900
If someone catches you partying here...

151
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,533
Who cares?

152
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:37,100
I'm a cop anyway.
I'll just say I'm working undercover.

153
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:40,100
Ooh, bad cop!

154
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,700
Excuse me.

155
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,100
It's fine.

156
00:08:59,233 --> 00:09:00,500
Whatever.

157
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,267
Hey.

158
00:09:19,567 --> 00:09:20,833
Takoi-san.

159
00:09:22,167 --> 00:09:25,667
What are you doing hanging
around a place like this?

160
00:09:27,133 --> 00:09:29,367
If there's a raid and you
get caught, you're finished.

161
00:09:35,033 --> 00:09:37,833
Are you trying to throw your career away?

162
00:09:42,467 --> 00:09:43,833
I'm just sick of everything.

163
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:47,400
Why does Shiono get all the breaks?

164
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:52,733
He knows nothing about real police work,
yet acts so high and mighty.

165
00:09:53,067 --> 00:09:56,967
And he wrapped you around
his finger without even trying.

166
00:09:58,767 --> 00:10:00,367
Just because of his pretty face,

167
00:10:00,733 --> 00:10:02,367
everyone buys his act.

168
00:10:03,767 --> 00:10:06,767
He's never struggled for anything,
yet he gets the best of it all.

169
00:10:06,867 --> 00:10:09,000
- Isn't that who he is?
- That's not true.

170
00:10:10,133 --> 00:10:11,867
Shiono isn't like that at all.

171
00:10:13,833 --> 00:10:15,233
Shiono is the kind of guy who...

172
00:10:18,533 --> 00:10:20,709
does the dirtiest, most exhausting
work without complaining.

173
00:10:20,733 --> 00:10:21,600
Cuffs!

174
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,500
He faces every challenge head-on.

175
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,900
I love you.

176
00:10:25,233 --> 00:10:27,700
Must be nice. The Detective
Division looks so fun.

177
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:29,167
You just don't see it.

178
00:10:29,267 --> 00:10:30,300
Am I interrupting?

179
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:32,200
He actually has zero people skills.

180
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:33,567
Because he's mine.

181
00:10:37,833 --> 00:10:39,433
I know all of this about him.

182
00:10:42,333 --> 00:10:43,733
What is this?

183
00:10:45,533 --> 00:10:47,373
Bragging about how
great your relationship is?

184
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,933
Don't get the wrong idea.

185
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:51,767
It's not like I was that crazy about you.

186
00:10:51,867 --> 00:10:54,333
I just thought fooling
around with me would be fun.

187
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:58,933
You said you wanted to take
your job seriously. Was that a lie?

188
00:11:02,567 --> 00:11:05,600
Whatever, forget it.

189
00:11:10,833 --> 00:11:12,967
You miscalculated, Takoi-san.

190
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:14,400
What?

191
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,133
Hey! Hey!

192
00:11:19,233 --> 00:11:20,933
- Let go of me!
- Shut up and stay still!

193
00:11:21,033 --> 00:11:23,467
Since you're already here,

194
00:11:25,333 --> 00:11:26,767
why not join the party?

195
00:11:32,233 --> 00:11:33,500
So handsome!

196
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:38,100
Cut me some slack!

197
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:40,733
Come on!

198
00:11:40,833 --> 00:11:42,767
- Put your hands behind your back!
- Move it!

199
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:46,067
- Don't move!
- You think you can do whatever you want?!

200
00:11:46,167 --> 00:11:48,333
Hey! Hey!

201
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:50,700
Let go!

202
00:11:52,333 --> 00:11:54,267
Teach him a lesson!

203
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:59,667
You call yourself a cop, you wimp?

204
00:11:59,767 --> 00:12:01,367
Hold him tight!

205
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:12,200
Takoi-san!

206
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:20,033
Shiono!

207
00:12:22,833 --> 00:12:24,400
Huh?

208
00:12:25,333 --> 00:12:26,667
Well, look who it is. Shiono-san.

209
00:12:27,867 --> 00:12:30,333
What, are you two on an undercover date?

210
00:12:31,033 --> 00:12:32,400
What do you think?

211
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:36,333
Just casing the place.

212
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,367
Tell me when the raid is happening,

213
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:53,100
and I'll let him go.

214
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,367
Hey!

215
00:12:54,467 --> 00:12:55,833
Do you have the guts?

216
00:12:56,867 --> 00:13:02,333
Would Shiono-san really throw away
his bright future for an old guy like this?

217
00:13:02,433 --> 00:13:03,867
Shiono, don't say it!

218
00:13:03,967 --> 00:13:05,367
Don't you dare!

219
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:16,533
Shiono!

220
00:13:26,933 --> 00:13:31,900
The raid is in two weeks, on Friday.

221
00:13:34,367 --> 00:13:35,633
Thanks.

222
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,300
Well, well.

223
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:39,800
Now you've done it.

224
00:13:40,633 --> 00:13:42,133
Say goodbye to your promotion.

225
00:13:45,467 --> 00:13:49,300
Actually, you won't even be a cop anymore.

226
00:13:55,333 --> 00:13:56,533
You're ruined.

227
00:13:58,033 --> 00:13:59,500
It's all on you.

228
00:14:08,633 --> 00:14:11,733
Maybe I should send this video to HQ?

229
00:14:12,267 --> 00:14:13,667
Shiono has nothing to do with this!

230
00:14:15,567 --> 00:14:18,367
You're just pissed because I rejected you!

231
00:14:18,467 --> 00:14:19,933
Leave him out of it!

232
00:14:20,667 --> 00:14:22,700
Delete that video right now!

233
00:14:23,333 --> 00:14:25,173
If you want a punching
bag, take it out on me!

234
00:14:25,733 --> 00:14:27,033
What?

235
00:14:27,133 --> 00:14:27,800
What are you talking about?!

236
00:14:27,900 --> 00:14:30,100
Come on, Omaeda!

237
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:32,833
Why do you think I told them?!

238
00:14:32,933 --> 00:14:34,567
How touching.

239
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,967
True love at its finest.

240
00:14:41,167 --> 00:14:46,867
Then I guess I'll have my fun.

241
00:14:49,533 --> 00:14:50,833
You bastard...

242
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:55,933
Get off! Why?!

243
00:14:58,867 --> 00:15:03,900
Didn't you tell me to quit
right in front of everyone?

244
00:15:05,667 --> 00:15:06,667
Those words...

245
00:15:07,467 --> 00:15:09,767
I've never forgotten them.

246
00:15:10,733 --> 00:15:15,933
Now it's my turn to scar you
in front of everyone.

247
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:26,267
Try to fight back, and I'll send that clip
straight to HQ.

248
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:28,167
You...

249
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:30,533
Fine.

250
00:15:32,567 --> 00:15:34,567
If this is what cools
you off, get it over with.

251
00:15:41,367 --> 00:15:42,733
Tell me something.

252
00:15:44,933 --> 00:15:46,500
Am I really that unreliable?

253
00:15:48,033 --> 00:15:49,033
What?

254
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:54,767
Our ranks and standing
are completely different, I know.

255
00:15:55,133 --> 00:15:58,167
Maybe I can't help you with any of that.

256
00:15:59,233 --> 00:16:00,300
Huh?

257
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:05,033
But I still want to help you!

258
00:16:09,333 --> 00:16:14,600
I want to fight for your future too!

259
00:16:17,567 --> 00:16:21,700
Enough talk.

260
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:23,400
Ready?

261
00:16:23,467 --> 00:16:24,867
That's far enough.

262
00:16:25,967 --> 00:16:27,700
Watch closely.

263
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:35,233
Let's see your boyfriend save you now.

264
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:54,267
Don't push your luck!

265
00:17:09,667 --> 00:17:11,000
Don't touch him.

266
00:17:11,933 --> 00:17:13,233
He belongs to me.

267
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Police!

268
00:17:21,067 --> 00:17:21,733
In here!

269
00:17:21,833 --> 00:17:23,100
Police!

270
00:17:24,433 --> 00:17:26,700
- Don't move!
- Screw you!

271
00:17:32,933 --> 00:17:34,133
Shiono!

272
00:17:36,633 --> 00:17:37,967
Are you all right?

273
00:17:51,367 --> 00:17:52,833
What a shame.

274
00:17:53,133 --> 00:17:56,433
The bullet missed. Shu must have held back.

275
00:17:58,833 --> 00:18:00,733
You can tell me all about it later.

276
00:18:04,100 --> 00:18:05,233
Whoa!

277
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,767
Are you serious?

278
00:18:07,467 --> 00:18:08,900
Takoi! Where is Takoi?!

279
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,100
Takoi-san!

280
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,200
The two of them slipped away somewhere.

281
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:14,567
Where did they go?

282
00:18:24,733 --> 00:18:25,800
Hmm?

283
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:29,200
Are you really okay?

284
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:30,500
I'll live.

285
00:18:32,067 --> 00:18:33,433
Thanks.

286
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:37,200
Those guys didn't pull any punches.

287
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:38,633
Give me a break.

288
00:18:40,533 --> 00:18:42,467
My handsome face is ruined.

289
00:18:43,733 --> 00:18:44,800
Just kidding.

290
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:46,100
Ow!

291
00:18:47,433 --> 00:18:47,900
That really hurts...

292
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,500
Look at you, all beaten up.

293
00:18:52,100 --> 00:18:53,900
You actually fired your gun.

294
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,900
What if you had hit me?

295
00:18:56,567 --> 00:18:58,867
There's no way I'd hit
you from that distance.

296
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:00,733
What?

297
00:19:00,833 --> 00:19:03,733
I've won awards for my
marksmanship, you know.

298
00:19:03,833 --> 00:19:05,633
Who do you think I am?

299
00:19:05,733 --> 00:19:08,167
On stationary targets, maybe!

300
00:19:08,267 --> 00:19:09,833
Moving targets are no different.

301
00:19:09,933 --> 00:19:11,633
Right...

302
00:19:11,733 --> 00:19:14,367
Master Shiono is the greatest.

303
00:19:22,067 --> 00:19:25,600
Once I climb higher up the ranks,

304
00:19:30,433 --> 00:19:34,933
I'll have you transferred to me,
whether it's HQ or anywhere else.

305
00:19:35,667 --> 00:19:37,000
What?

306
00:19:37,967 --> 00:19:38,967
That way,

307
00:19:41,033 --> 00:19:42,867
we can stay together for good.

308
00:19:47,933 --> 00:19:52,967
I don't want to constantly worry
that someone's going to steal you away

309
00:19:53,967 --> 00:19:55,867
every time we're apart.

310
00:19:57,967 --> 00:19:59,800
You're exaggerating.

311
00:20:00,233 --> 00:20:01,367
I can't help being scared.

312
00:20:14,067 --> 00:20:15,567
Look only at me.

313
00:20:17,933 --> 00:20:20,533
I'm giving you my entire life.

314
00:20:25,867 --> 00:20:27,067
I love you.

315
00:20:31,733 --> 00:20:33,433
I'm not letting anyone else have you.

316
00:20:37,467 --> 00:20:38,800
What are you talking about?

317
00:20:40,733 --> 00:20:41,843
I've never been more serious.

318
00:20:41,867 --> 00:20:44,967
All this talk about someone stealing me...

319
00:20:46,167 --> 00:20:47,467
Stop it.

320
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:54,867
I really do love you.

321
00:20:54,967 --> 00:20:56,933
I thought I made that loud and clear.

322
00:20:59,267 --> 00:21:01,067
I know.

323
00:21:01,167 --> 00:21:02,300
Huh?

324
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:11,467
So stop saying I'd just settle for anyone.

325
00:21:12,933 --> 00:21:16,533
You're the only one for me too.

326
00:21:22,333 --> 00:21:23,433
Okay.

327
00:21:25,233 --> 00:21:29,400
Everything I have is yours too.

328
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:51,967
This is all I have to give
you right now, though.

329
00:21:55,667 --> 00:21:58,100
I mean, I'll get you
something better next time.

330
00:22:15,667 --> 00:22:19,267
Cheat on me, and I'll shoot you.

331
00:22:22,333 --> 00:22:23,633
How terrifying.

332
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:42,867
Duty First, Kiss Later
